IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `uro-nouns`
IMPORT `uro-part3-housing-benefit`

-- Tests of uro-part3-housing-benefit (arts 23 and 24, Schedules 4 to 7 to the Order). Every expected figure is read by
-- hand from the line of the text cited beside it (uksi-2026-148.txt). The non-dependant deductions of arts 23(3) and
-- 24(3) are tested in uro-tests-non-dependant-deductions.l4.

GIVEN old IS A NUMBER
      new IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `a sum and its replacement`
`the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` old new MEANS `a sum and its replacement` OF old, new

§ `Article 23(2) -- regulation 27(3), sums that remain unchanged (src:222-223)`

#ASSERT `art 23(2): the replaced and the replacing sum` `Housing Benefit regulation 27(3)(a)` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 175.00 175.00
#ASSERT `art 23(2): the replaced and the replacing sum` `Housing Benefit regulation 27(3)(b)` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 300 300

