#ASSERT `art 23(4): the replaced and the replacing sum` `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(3)(a) and (b)(i) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 24.00 24.90
#ASSERT `art 23(4): the replaced and the replacing sum` `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(3)(b)(ii) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 12.00 12.45
#ASSERT `art 23(4): the replaced and the replacing sum` `Housing Benefit paragraph 2(5) of Part 1 of Schedule 1` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 4.35 4.50

