§ `Article 23(6)(b), (7), (9), (10), (11) (src:256, 258-259, 262-263, 264, 265)`

#ASSERT `art 23(6)(b): paragraph 2(1) of Part 1 of Schedule 3 to the Housing Benefit Regulations, sub-paragraphs (a) and (b) of column (2) of the table` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 84.66 87.88
-- (7) applies "in a case falling within regulation 4 of the 2015 Regulations": outside such a case the Order says nothing
#ASSERT `art 23(7): the family premium sums in a case falling within regulation 4 of the 2015 Regulations` `Housing Benefit family premium paragraph 3(1)(a)` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 22.20 22.20)
#ASSERT `art 23(7): the family premium sums in a case falling within regulation 4 of the 2015 Regulations` `Housing Benefit family premium paragraph 3(1)(b)` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 19.48 20.22)
#ASSERT `art 23(7): the family premium sums in a case falling within regulation 4 of the 2015 Regulations` `Housing Benefit family premium paragraph 3(1)(a)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `art 23(7): the family premium sums in a case falling within regulation 4 of the 2015 Regulations` `Housing Benefit family premium paragraph 3(1)(b)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (9)(a) applies to paragraph 25 only in cases within paragraphs 2 to 7 of Schedule 2 to the 2017 Regulations; (9)(b) is not so limited
#ASSERT `art 23(9): the sums in force for the case` `Housing Benefit paragraph 25 of Part 6 of Schedule 3` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 36.55 37.95)
#ASSERT `art 23(9): the sums in force for the case` `Housing Benefit paragraph 25 of Part 6 of Schedule 3` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `art 23(9): the sums in force for the case` `Housing Benefit paragraph 26 of Part 6 of Schedule 3` TRUE EQUALS JUST (`the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 48.50 50.35)
#ASSERT `art 23(9): the sums in force for the case` `Housing Benefit paragraph 26 of Part 6 of Schedule 3` FALSE EQUALS JUST (`the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 48.50 50.35)
#ASSERT `art 23(10): paragraph 17(1) and (3)(c) of Schedule 4 to the Housing Benefit Regulations, the earnings disregard` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 17.10 17.10
#ASSERT `art 23(11): paragraph 56 of Schedule 5 to the Housing Benefit Regulations, the disregard of income other than earnings` EQUALS `the pair of sums in the housing benefit tests` 17.10 17.10

