#ASSERT `Sch 7 (1): the severe disability premium` `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 6(2)(b) condition` TRUE EQUALS 86.05
#ASSERT `Sch 7 (1): the severe disability premium` `Housing Benefit (SPC) paragraph 6(2)(b) condition` FALSE EQUALS 172.10
#ASSERT `Sch 7 (2): the enhanced disability premium` 1 EQUALS 33.99
#ASSERT `Sch 7 (3): the disabled child premium` 3 EQUALS 253.38
#ASSERT `Sch 7 (4): the carer premium` 1 EQUALS 48.15
